//Siege class def file.

ClassInfo
{
	name			"bast_ren_med"
	weapons			WP_MELEE|WP_CR2
        attributes	        MB_ATT_AMMO,3|MB_ATT_CR2,3|MB_ATT_HEALING,1|MB_ATT_DISP_HEALTH,2|MB_ATT_DISP_AMMO,1|MB_ATT_DODGE,1|MB_ATT_BACTA_BIG,1|MB_ATT_STIMPACK,1
	maxhealth		120
        maxarmor                120
        classflags              CFL_STATVIEWER
        WP_CR2Flags             HELD_AMMOREGEN
	model			"renegade_male2" 				//this is optional, if it's here it forces the model to this.
	skin			"default"					//this is optional, if it's here it forces the skin to this.
        uishader	        "models/players/renegade_male2/mb2_icon_default"
	MBClass			MB_CLASS_ELITETROOPER
	classNumberLimit	1
        flourishAnim            TORSO_RAISEWEAP4
}

WeaponInfo0
{
	WeaponToReplace		WP_CR2					//Required: Weapon Slot of weapon you're replacing
	WeaponBasedOff		WP_CR2				//Required: For future use, should be the same as WeaponToReplace
	NewWorldModel		"models/weapons2/A280/A280_w.glm"  	//Required: New 3rd person/dropped weapon model
	NewViewModel		"models/weapons2/A280/A280.md3" 	  	//Required: New 1st person weapon model
	Icon			"gfx/hud/w_icon_A280" 	//Required: Weapon change icon
	WeaponName		"A280 Modified"    					//Required: Weapon change display name
        altFireEnabled          1
        customAmmo              1000
}

description	"Renegade Squadron: Medic

Weaponry:
A280 Modified (Faster fire rate)

Items:
Medpack 
Stimpack

Abilities:
Dodge 1 ^3CS1^7
Self Heal 1
Team Heal (Use on teammates)
Ammo Drop (Use on teammates)

The Renegade Squadron was a Rebel Alliance military unit of pirates, smugglers, and other types of fringers assembled and commanded by Col Serra at Han Solo's request. The unit consisted of underworlders recruited by Serra from around the galaxy."


